				<r3d:description language="eng">DDE DPR is a repository of geoscience data established with the support of Deep-time Digital Earth international big science program (DDE), which is committed to building a resource base for long-term data sharing and data release. Users can provide their research results to consumers in a discoverable, shareable and referential way, provide long-term preservation, sharing and acquisition services for scientific data, and promote the findability, accessibility, interoperability and reusability (FAIR) of data on the basis of protecting the rights and interests of data authors, so as to promote the sharing of geoscience data.</r3d:description>
